# Study blocks for the countdown, one per line: day of the month, start, end, label.
# Times are HH:MM; an end past 24:00 runs into the next day, like 23:30 24:30.
# The bar counts down the current block, or shows how long until the next one.
# Copy it to ~/.config/dwm-status/study-schedule, or to study-schedule.stopped to
# start it later from the timer menu.
14 09:00 10:30 Lecture 1
14 10:45 12:15 Lecture 2
14 13:15 14:45 Exercises
14 15:00 16:30 Summary
15 09:00 10:30 Lecture 3
15 10:45 12:15 Past exam
15 13:15 15:00 Review mistakes
